    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Dixon Residential Estate Agents are delighted to present 164 Captain's Road to the Dublin 12 property market.\r\n\r\nThis beautiful property comes to the market having been upgraded and extended to the rear to create a truly exceptional home. \r\n\r\nOn entrance to this property, we are met with a spacious hallway, to the front lies a downstairs bedroom. To the rear is a living room which opens onto the extended kitchen/dining area perfect for hosting with direct access to the rear garden. Upstairs there are two double bedrooms and a family bathroom. The property also boasts spacious front and rear garden.\r\n\r\nCaptains Road is a highly sought-after address situated between Stannaway Road and Lower Kimmage, placing it within easy reach of the vibrant and well-established neighbourhoods of Kimmage, Crumlin, Harold’s Cross and Terenure. Both Sundrive and Ashleaf Shopping Centres are just minutes away, offering an excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and everyday amenities. Families are particularly well catered for, with a wide choice of highly regarded primary and secondary schools in the surrounding area.The villages of Sundrive, Kimmage, Terenure and Harold’s Cross are all within comfortable walking or cycling distance, providing a wealth of local services, eateries and community facilities. Recreational opportunities are equally abundant, with Bushy Park, renowned for its weekend market, scenic walking trails and extensive sporting facilities, located approximately 2km away. Even closer are Eamonn Ceannt Park and Stannaway Park, both offering excellent green spaces for leisure and outdoor activities.For commuters, the location is exceptionally convenient, providing swift access to Dublin City Centre and the M50 motorway, which connects seamlessly to the wider national road network.\r\n\r\nEarly viewing is advised\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Turnkey Home\r\nExtended Kitchen/Living Space\r\nPrivate Rear Garden\r\nPrime Location\r\nCombi-Gas-Fired-Boiler\r\n95 SQM\r\nFeature fireplace in the living room"
      },
